                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pa bushiku bwa fisabo fyantanshi ilyo muletuula kuli Yawe umutuulo wa cabunga ubupya pa nshikunkulu ya milungu, kuleba ukulongana kwamushilo, kabili tekwesha kubombamo imilimo ya cila bushiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muletuula ilambo lyakoca ilya fiponti fya ŋombe ifilume fibili, sukusuku umo no twana twa mpaanga utulume cine lubali utwa mwaka umo umo ngo mutuulo wa cena cisuma icisekesha Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali cila cilume wa ŋombe paleba umutuulo wa cabunga utwapekumi tutatu utwa ku cipimo ca efa wa bunga bwa ŋanu ubwapeleka bwino ubwasanshiwamo na mafuta ya miolifa. Pali sukusuku paleba utwapekumi tubili twa ku cipimo ca efa wa bunga ubwapeleka bwino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo pali cila kana ka mpanga pa twana twa mpaanga cine lubali, capekumi cimo ica efa wa bunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili mulundepo sawe umo uwakumufutilapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulepekanya ifi fyonse pamo no mutuulo wa fyakunwa, mukulunda pelambo lyakoca ilya cila bushiku, no mutuulo wa cabunga. Mushininkishe bwino ukuti inama shonse tashikwete akalema.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.31"
            ]
          }
        }
